/* ===== Knowledge index · compact line-art empty state / scroll retention v8 ===== */
/* The visible panel is allowed to become compact. The transparent retainer below it
   absorbs the inverse height change, so the document footprint stays stable and the
   browser does not clamp the user back toward the graph when a search becomes empty. */
.knowledge-index .index-scroll-retainer {
